## SLIDE 3 — Technical Approach

### 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Frontend** | React.js, React Router, Context API, Vite |
| **Backend** | Node.js, Express.js |
| **Database** | MongoDB (via Mongoose ODM) |
| **Authentication** | JWT (JSON Web Tokens) + bcrypt |
| **Image Storage** | Cloudinary + Multer |
| **AI (Planned)** | Google Gemini API |
| **Maps (Planned)** | Leaflet.js / Google Maps API |
| **Version Control** | Git + GitHub |
| **Hosting (Planned)** | Render (backend) + Vercel (frontend) |

---

### ⚙️ Methodology & Implementation Process

```
Phase 1 — Core Platform (DONE ✅)
  ├── User Auth & Role System (Tourist / Guide / Organizer / Admin)
  ├── Destinations, Transport, Accommodations modules
  ├── Cultural Experiences & Bookings
  ├── Guide Profiles & Verification
  └── Role-specific Dashboards

Phase 2 — AI & Intelligence Layer (Planned 🔵)
  ├── AI Chatbot via Gemini API
  ├── Personalized Itinerary Generator
  └── Feedback Sentiment Analysis

Phase 3 — Enhanced UX (Planned 🔵)
  ├── Interactive Maps with Geo-location
  ├── Tribal Handicraft Marketplace
  └── Multilingual Interface (Hindi / Santhali)
```

**Data Flow:**
```
Tourist → React Frontend → Express REST API → MongoDB
                          ↓
              Cloudinary (images) | Gemini API (AI)
                          ↓
              Admin Dashboard ← Analytics Aggregation
```

**API Architecture:** RESTful API with 8 route groups:
`auth` | `destinations` | `transport` | `accommodations` | `experiences` | `guides` | `bookings` | `admin`

