---

### ⚠️ Potential Challenges & Risks

| Challenge | Risk Level | Mitigation Strategy |
|---|---|---|
| Low digital literacy among tribal artisans | High | Simple UI, regional language support, field agent onboarding |
| Fake guide registrations | Medium | Admin-controlled verification system + review ratings |
| Unreliable internet in remote areas | High | Lightweight pages, offline-first data caching (future) |
| Data privacy of local communities | Medium | Role-based data access, no PII shared publicly |
| AI chatbot accuracy for regional content | Medium | Fine-tune prompts with Jharkhand-specific context |
| Scaling during peak tourist seasons | Low | Cloud-hosted, MongoDB Atlas auto-scales |
| Government/Tourism Dept. adoption | Medium | Clean admin dashboard with actionable analytics |

